{"version":1,"content":"<p>遊台灣坐火車常會吃便當，台鐵統計，去年便當營收達8.76億元新台幣（約2.1億港元），創歷年新高，全年共售出942萬個便當，其中排骨便當賣出718萬個，穩居人氣冠軍，雞腿便當以56萬個居次。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:32.314770+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T07:54:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T14:58:43.189353+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:10.129573+00:00","content_hash":"97d06c7a1d17f0f25e4e6f9aa1099ff928db9328fd0230fe8cbb3b5c56c1a72b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}